  "draft_py": "# Devout Decree: \"Exile target creature or planeswalker that's black or red. Scry 1.\"\n# Exile: B5a-exile-cw-pw (Angelic Ascension) with the colour restriction ANDed on:\n# \"black or red\" = FOr of COLOR_HAS (guide: never COLOR_IN). Scry 1: the compiled B5b-scr step.\nexile = A(Verb.MOVE_ZONE, {\n    'destination': Zone(kind=ZoneKind.EXILE, controller=ControllerRef.OWNER),\n    'target': Selector(\n        count=QConst(value=1),\n        mode=SelectorMode.TARGET,\n        filter=FAnd(children=(\n            FOr(children=(\n                FAtom(pred=FAtomPred.TYPE_EQ, string_value='Creature'),\n                FAtom(pred=FAtomPred.TYPE_EQ, string_value='Planeswalker'),\n            )),\n            FOr(children=(\n                FAtom(pred=FAtomPred.COLOR_HAS, color='B'),\n                FAtom(pred=FAtomPred.COLOR_HAS, color='R'),\n            )),\n        )),\n        zones=(Zone(kind=ZoneKind.BATTLEFIELD, controller=ControllerRef.ANY),),\n    ),\n})\nscry = compiled[0].effect   # A(Verb.SCRY, {'controller': YOU, 'count': QConst(1)})\nabilities = [SpellAbility(kind=SpellKind.SORCERY, effect=Seq(steps=(exile, scry)))]\n",
  "clauses": [
